e and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le01ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Describing People"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adjectives to describe people.<br/><br/>You can also use nouns to say what a person has, like a beard."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The adjective can be placed:<br/><br/>- Before the person<br/>- After the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">to have</span><br/>- After an expression like \u201cwith \u2026 \u201d"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short, tall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blond, brunette\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thin, heavyset\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"man, woman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown, blue, green, beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eyes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blond, brown, black, gray\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"long, short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lovely, friendly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smile\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The tall woman is in the office. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's a short man."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's a heavyset man with a beard. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Surprise"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Here are some expressions showing surprise."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We saw many remains of the ancient Inca civilization. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow, that's amazing!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Really?<br/> Wow, that's amazing!<br/> Go on!<br/> You don't say!<br/> Is that right?<br/>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inspiring"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "gives you strong feelings"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peru is an awesome country. It's very inspiring."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you to describe people and experiences."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coastal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "located at the coast (between land and ocean)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We stopped at a coastal village. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "smile"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the action you make with your face to show happiness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has long brown hair and a lovely smile."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slender"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She's a slender brunette with beautiful brown eyes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remains"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stones or other materials left from buildings in other time periods"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We saw many remains of the ancient Inca civilization."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of surprising things a person could tell you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue of 5 lines for each person. One person tells the story. The other person reacts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue describing a story."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I react to surprising things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}